{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "97bbadb04ef66ea575cc0db1d80f2538eae509d4e33d5f7121413a7a592b7033", "ja": "番宣は……ハプニング？", "zh": "宣传节目是……突发状况？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "33c5e78f8d180976da9ebd7f2003f69bfbb3d5e3032c3900a757663176bf0553", "ja": "一方、BOTの宣伝も兼ねてTV番組に出演\nする風花たち。バチバチのライバル関係を\nアピールするはずが、口が自然に仲良し\nトークを展開してしまい……。宣伝はできた\nものの、プロデューサーは首を傾げる。", "zh": "另一方面，为了宣传BOT，风花她们还出演了电视节目。\n本该展现针锋相对的竞争关系，嘴上却自然而然地聊起了亲密话题……\n虽然宣传是做到了，但制作人却不禁歪起了脑袋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e31dfa091fcaee3ce04fa2c26c90cddf8475edaf8d8b8cc2b930d611068c17db", "ja": "（情報番組出演のため、TV局に来ている。\n今は本番前の打ち合わせ中だ）", "zh": "（为了参加资讯节目，大家来到了电视台。现在正在进行节目开始前的沟通。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "6089e21464305fb6f6e9b11adeecc58c383915d60b92da6ea8bea077bbba5ddf", "ja": "……で、この辺りで司会者から話題をフリますから、\n思いっきりイベントの宣伝をしていただければと！", "zh": "……然后在这里，主持人会抛出相关话题，到时候请尽情宣传活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "41b82b718b6c32ad869b4cb4a11c2e491584f2f3e8aed81103ea896ad6b8641f", "ja": "はい！　私たちは台本通り、\n火花を散らしている感じで……ですよね？", "zh": "好的！我们会按照剧本，营造出火花四溅的感觉……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "03c35b76c7d6fc86d1e6c91a7729b1e3e7a98779a2787151c666a1344fa4147b", "ja": "無理にシリアスにしなくても大丈夫だ。\n熱く見えるよう、煽ってくれたらいいから。", "zh": "不用刻意表现得很严肃。\n只要煽动气氛，让场面看起来够火热就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "1723befb70ae86324aba68b88222550eb073fa5afdd130a26c5f1dec540df7fb", "ja": "熱く……ですね。わかりました～。", "zh": "要营造热烈的气氛……明白了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "76a276e3f2454ec6ee745ad2347f2022e19e6751edf14af46bceb29f6c5eda56", "ja": "みんなで思いっきり盛り上げてくるわよ～！\n期待しててね、{$P$}。", "zh": "我们会和大家一起彻底把气氛炒热的～！\n好好期待吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1007_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "fc30351f8723e83be109055cf1c915f368112390e5af292cb7ee8b860366b12a", "ja": "皆さんは今、『BATTLE OF THEATER』\nというシリーズの真っ最中なんですよね！", "zh": "大家现在正处于《BATTLE OF THEATER》系列的激战之中呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "9330af79498d6664028cd78aa2eed73d661432df20ad212327e61eb0d9f55a2a", "ja": "はい！　765プロの頂点を賭けて、\n手加減なしのバトルに挑んでいるところです！", "zh": "没错！我们正在为争夺765Pro的顶点，挑战一场毫不留情的战斗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "5ba1b20e92a72039202db35ea975ea86e75e4e834e41ba5b3620bf92e9274464", "ja": "私たち、普段は仲良しですけど。\nアイドルとしては、ライバルでもありますから～。", "zh": "我们平时关系很好，但作为偶像，彼此也是竞争对手呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1010_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "6dfa10c373a0c568e697d39bc86a320c58584707ac949144be32867d13b495e3", "ja": "アイドルの皆さんによる、仁義なきバトル……\nいやー、いつもながら攻めた企画ですね！", "zh": "偶像们之间展开的无仁无义之战……哎呀，真是和往常一样大胆的企划呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "e8e848cc0cb9e943bf6a1faa2d27690b26ae25f1f1f5123ad79463e822197a6b", "ja": "そうなんです！　私たちも真剣勝負を楽しんでます♪\nね？　風花ちゃん、あずさちゃん。", "zh": "没错！我们也很享受这场认真的较量♪\n对吧？风花、小梓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c60be4465dd47270255d3e1550c6a504cf9cc9f1f519d9ed36cec248aef57c0f", "ja": "はい！　やるからには絶対に負けられないって、\n私たちみんな、バチバチに……", "zh": "是的！既然要参加，就绝对不能输，\n我们大家都在全力以赴地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1013_se", "source_sha256": "90ae0382c3f5ba1eefd218e7d2d431b82984e0ad546bafd88e71daad41c387d5", "ja": "……ピカッ！", "zh": "……闪光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eeeba2afd8a7305453d8dfaa1dd61a5f3b48e265babb875200b2ac6518f9caf9", "ja": "……そう、バチバチに仲良しだから、\n今日もこの後、一緒にお弁当を食べる予定なんです♪", "zh": "……对，因为我们的关系“好到冒火花”，\n今天这之后也打算一起吃便当呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "132508855d216e1e7eda93cb8d182a80796bee51777b9f3370944f6ea3fec11f", "ja": "そう、おべんと……えっ！？　風花ちゃん？", "zh": "对，便当……咦！？风花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f936aa5e999b876258a145403e68fe7b74d33dea4e8d4a9411dd083cf62f2546", "ja": "あ、あれっ？　私、何を言って……？", "zh": "啊，咦？我刚才在说什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1017_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "16fa20d16f1a1611023721fff9feed1c0ea0ea094df80ba5b242c4e37159479f", "ja": "いやいや、バチバチに仲良しって言いませんよね！？\nホラ、そこは違うでしょ？　バチバチに～……？", "zh": "不对不对，哪有人会说“火药味十足地要好”啊！？\n你看，这里不对吧？火药味十足地～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "7ec77599014588a2c5b3a1e0b0d335a1e55c6787a19d8524c3a79721dba32081", "ja": "はい～！　私たちみんなで、\nバチバチに戦って、競い合って……！", "zh": "好～！我们大家一起，\n激烈地战斗，互相竞争……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1019_se", "source_sha256": "90ae0382c3f5ba1eefd218e7d2d431b82984e0ad546bafd88e71daad41c387d5", "ja": "……ピカッ！", "zh": "……闪光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "75471f39c9e65f3389473eca8cc99effad6fdf144cc92593e8b1198e90efb4fa", "ja": "……なんて、そんな無意味なことはしません。\nやっぱり世界はラブアンドピースです～、イェーイ♪", "zh": "……开玩笑的，我才不会做那么没有意义的事呢。\n世界果然还是需要爱与和平呀～，耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6b8d8553c471ee1492679d250264ce4013dcad955875ebf00604f91c04f13e99", "ja": "えっ！　あ、あずささん……！？", "zh": "诶！　梓、梓小姐……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "2f5d026c7ab43a2d54ae94dc2be492550e4c4d15b8075f2af37a434f36d3b219", "ja": "はっ。あ、あら～……？", "zh": "啊。哎呀～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "df0e129e9308fd8641642c9cbf5752a16a23c1783c922f5256743765b1995f61", "ja": "このみさん、あずささん、お疲れさまでした。\n風花もお疲れさま。", "zh": "木下小姐、三浦小姐，辛苦了。\n风花也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "29e4e89bf2b638cd80d2a09b4f0686b79a6af030a643a89ba26b805490a2540c", "ja": "ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん！\n途中で私、おかしなこと言っちゃって……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生！  \n我在中途说了些奇怪的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "514f4ff137eb71c55901fba5ec5271e0c2545a6b99979c8e40b889e81e04fc16", "ja": "いや、宣伝はできたから大丈夫だよ。でも珍しいな、\nみんながあんなアドリブを入れるなんて。", "zh": "没事，宣传也已经做到了。不过还真少见，大家居然会加进那样的即兴发挥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "cd03e25af20d610b122d8008ca6bff1ce5006fbe721a7c041eaa75b12dd31d9b", "ja": "それが、アドリブっていうか……突然、口から\n言葉が出てしまって。これを見てください～。", "zh": "那个，与其说是即兴发挥……不如说是突然就脱口而出了。请看看这个～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "5d0c4268e31301509bfd80f95b4de5c4b2729658be9350ce7ae68c7f87daf4dc", "ja": "これは、台本ですか……えっ？　台詞に赤が入って……\nさっきの台詞になってますね！？", "zh": "这是剧本吗……咦？台词上被用红笔改过了……\n改成刚才那句台词了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "7da53487b24906e9482301714267776c0cbeebbec31da7efe2f1e2464f6e1f88", "ja": "私の台本もよ、修正されてるの。\nいつの間にこんなこと……誰かのイタズラかしら？", "zh": "我的剧本也被修改了。什么时候变成这样的……是谁恶作剧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "43d87adb750896c5dd48848a8c51dbb029e6f388306415f06cb134d04fb3f551", "ja": "いたずら、ですか……うーん……\n……ん？", "zh": "恶作剧吗……唔……\n……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "95fc1a2c9e53384d5fe5b624f3badffc6030791b4ab39e01468d488ddd911deb", "ja": "あれっ！？　今の人影って……！？", "zh": "咦！？刚才那个人影是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "140220cbcead3d303a768eae4dfddc3f18b2d5cd0bbd714f8a0521c841473cf9", "ja": "{$P$}さん？　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？　怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "3802c476cf1e5ab6d3adf19e67f0d22d6c1dc1f5eac978a82668f0b0bd47145a", "ja": "あっ……いや、なんでもない。とりあえず、\n内容的には問題なかったし、撤収ということで……。", "zh": "啊……没什么。总之，内容上没问题，就先收工吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "ca97a27a9a755dc42833df7463ad5d4bd1f73100ecf6c49a0b0553af81e61a4a", "ja": "（見間違い、か？　うーん……？）", "zh": "（看错了吗？嗯——……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
